{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_47","type":"agent_message","text":"Both required read-only gates exited successfully. `surface-check` reported 213 results and zero findings; `artifact-check` reported provenance warnings.\n\nI found another association-parsing gap: encoded Markdown destinations can be silently discarded. A link such as `../adr/decision%2Emd` names `decision.md`, but the reader neither resolves it nor reports unknown. That can incorrectly exempt a two-member roadmap from review. I’m checking both directions and the remaining closeout readers before concluding."}}
